block.txt:
This Subdivision applies to a trial of a person
for an offence, or attempt to commit an offence, against the Crimes Act 1900, section 61I, 61J, 61JA,
61KC, 61KD, 61KE or 61KF.

In an indictment for larceny or embezzlement as a
public servant, the property may be described as the property of the State,
from which it is taken to have been stolen.

Date of commencement of Sch 2.11, 17.7.2009, sec 2 (2);
date of commencement of Sch 3, 17.7.2009, sec 2
(1).

